    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm on a different frequency. like everyone else is tuned into this shallow, noisy channel and i'm just... gone. i did what i was supposed to do, i served, i saw things, but now i'm just coming back to a world that feels completely empty. it's like i don't even belong in the land of the living anymore. does that even make sense?",
